   "briefTitle": "A Study of Aleglitazar in Combination With Metformin in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus Who Are Inadequately Controlled With Metformin Alone",
   "officialTitle": "A Multicenter, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Phase III Study to Assess the Efficacy, Safety and Tolerability of Aleglitazar Plus Metformin Combination Therapy Compared With Placebo Plus Metformin in Patients With T2D Inadequately Controlled With Metformin Monotherapy"
